 '/stitching/':{eyebrow:'TAILORING SERVICES',title:'Ladies suit stitching in Lahore',startingPrice:1500,intro:'Custom shalwar kameez and ladies suits planned around your preferred fit, neckline, sleeves, shirt length and trouser style.',image:IMAGES.stitching,faq:[['What should I bring for ladies suit stitching?','Bring your fabric, a reference photo if available and notes about your preferred fit. Message first to confirm how to arrange your order.'],['Can I request a custom shalwar kameez design?','Yes. Share a photo, sketch or description so the style, fabric requirements and finishing can be discussed.'],['How much does ladies suit stitching cost?','Ladies simple shirt stitching is Rs. 1,000; simple suit Rs. 1,200; simple suit with Farshi shalwar Rs. 1,800; Dori piping suit Rs. 1,500; lining suit / party wear Rs. 2,500; and Angrakha suit Rs. 3,000–5,000. Separate shalwar and trouser rates are listed on the full rate list. Confirm the final design quote before work begins.'],['Can I provide my own fabric?','You can discuss your own fabric with Arisha. Share its details and the outfit reference before cutting so quantity and suitability can be reviewed.'],['Can I provide my own measurements?','Yes. You can share your measurements or arrange to visit the shop for measurements. Confirm the details before stitching begins.'],['How long does a suit take to stitch?','Turnaround depends on the garment, design details and current workload. Confirm the expected completion date when placing the order.'],['Is home delivery available in Lahore?','Home delivery is available in confirmed Lahore service areas. Ask about coverage, charges and timing before placing the order.'],['Can I get fabric picked up from my home?','No. Doorstep fabric pickup is not available. Contact Arisha to discuss how to arrange your fabric and order.']]},
